      "id": "silt-plain",
      "category": "texture",
      "brief": "Production game background texture for BRINE underwater station builder. One square continuous deep-ocean SILT PLAIN seabed texture, orthographic overhead camera, no horizon. Subdued blue-green charcoal and muted slate sediment, broad quiet areas of fine silt, low gently curving sand ripples, sparse tiny gravel, subtle darker mineral patches. Carefully rendered chunky pixel-art illustration with selective fine detail, same material realism as industrial pixel-art station sprites. Flat restrained ambient illumination from upper left, no sunlight beams, no bright caustics, no surface waves. Low contrast, dark but visible, designed to sit underneath much brighter modular station rooms. Edge-to-edge ground, no border, no objects cropped into prominent seams, no structures, no creatures, no text, no UI. Aim for seamless repeat, evenly distributed quiet texture without a central focal subject. 2048 square.",
